{"screen_name": "unonoroute", "file": "unonoroute", "name": "うのると/unoruto", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1721645591644790784/3a8S_Iad.jpg", "header_url": "", "description": "R18,大スカトロ/ ケモスカという狭いジャンルの絵や漫画を描くアカウント pixiv/fanbox/Skeb/DLsite/BOOTH/patreon等へのリンク→https://linktr.ee/unoruto", "total_works": 45, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2025-09-27T00:59:06.798124", "last_updated": "2025-09-27T00:59:06.798124", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 12000, "recorded_at": "2025-09-27T00:59:06.798124"}], "comic": [{"amount": 30000, "recorded_at": "2025-09-27T00:59:06.798124"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 12000, "comic": 30000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 12000, "max": 12000}, "comic": {"min": 30000, "max": 30000}}, "links": [{"label": "Website", "url": "https://linktr.ee/unoruto", "name": ""}], "works": [{"path": "/@unonoroute/works/45", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e97c1bf6/uploads/origins/b59e8977-0055-45be-b72c-046f1a25e7e7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2a9a31cc10dd487d0842190c19f1873a", "thumbnail_srcset": "", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@unonoroute/works/44", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f87b1d3f/uploads/origins/3b358720-47c5-47d0-9761-81449624a28f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dc11d0c8ac47ed8a7d1d9e9b9b07099b", "thumbnail_srcset": "", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "初めまして。\n\nブルアカの早瀬ユウカが和式トイレで一本糞を出し終わった後に「臭い…」と自分のうんちの臭いに鼻を摘んで悶絶するというイラストのリクエストよろしいでしょうか？\n\nそれではよろしくお願い致します。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@unonoroute/works/43", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6366d3cc/uploads/origins/a2f1c982-adef-4f4e-98e1-914b99626ae1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=midd